rnnoise_voice_lq.rnnn

Source: https://github.com/GregorR/rnnoise-models
        leavened-quisling-2018-08-31/lq.rnnn
        (expected signal: voice, including non-speech human sounds such as laughter;
         expected noise: general)

The repository states: "With the exception of the tools/ directory and this file,
none of this work is creative and thus none of it is subject to copyright."

The model is used with FFmpeg's arnndn filter (RNNoise, BSD-3-Clause, by Jean-Marc Valin).
